how ?thesis using environment_value_presents_unique[OF left(1) other] same by blast\nqed\n\ntheorem environment_value_quoted_total:\n  assumes formed: \"environment_formed E\"\n  shows \"\\<exists>C I. exact_formed C \\<and> environment_value_quoted_at C [] E I \\<and>\n    rra_carrier (object_structure C)=I\"\nproof -\n  obtain t where present: \"environment_value_presents E t\"\n    using environment_value_presents_total[OF formed] by blast\n  have tf: \"term_formed t\" and closed: \"self_contained_term t\"\n    using environment_value_presents_formed[OF present] by auto\n  have quote: \"self_contained_quoted_at (term_syntax t) [] t (term_syntax_interior t)\"\n    and source: \"exact_formed (term_syntax t)\"\n    and complete: \"rra_carrier (object_structure (term_syntax t))=term_syntax_interior t\"\n    using self_contained_quotation_total[OF tf closed] by auto\n  have read: \"environment_value_quoted_at (term_syntax t) [] E (term_syntax_interior t)\"\n    using present quote unfolding environment_value_quoted_at_def by blast\n  show ?thesis\n    by (rule exI[of _ \"term_syntax t\"], rule exI[of _ \"term_syntax_interior t\"])\n       (use source read complete in blast)\nqed\n\ntext \\<open>\n  The represented environment is exact finite data, including the complete\n  artifact at each use and every source-slot-target binding. Equal artifact\n  values at distinct uses remain distinct rows. Binding cycles are finite\n  relations and require no recursive expansion of the use graph.\n\n  Use coordinates are option-valued finite words. Their natural components\n  have an injective payload-and-pair presentation, so no byte restriction is\n  imposed on mathematical use coordinates. Every formed environment of this\n  native construction class has a complete self-contained quotation. Recovering\n  its value reads no outer-environment binding.\n\n  Environment formation is checked here. Grammar-derived closure and the\n  admissibility of an application in this represented