          "theory": "Factor_Investigation_Input_Execution",
          "source": "theory Factor_Investigation_Input_Execution\n  imports Factor_Investigation_Input_Contracts Factor_Observation_Scope_Execution\nbegin\n\nsection \\<open>Finite execution calls the actual complete input operation\\<close>\n\ndefinition investigation_input_octets :: \"nat list \\<Rightarrow> nat list \\<Rightarrow> nat list \\<Rightarrow>\n    (nat\\<times>nat\\<times>nat) list \\<Rightarrow> (nat\\<times>nat) list \\<Rightarrow> bool\" where\n  \"investigation_input_octets C U F rows relation \\<longleftrightarrow>\n    (338,Pair_Term (observation_scope_argument (data_list_term (map observation_octet C))\n      (data_list_term (map observation_octet U)) (data_list_term (map observation_octet F))\n      (data_list_term (map observation_row_term (map observation_octet_row rows))))\n      (data_list_term (map data_pair_term (map observation_octet_value relation))))\\<in>positive_meaning investigation_input_system\"\n\nlemma investigation_input_octets_code [code]:\n  \"investigation_input_octets C U F rows relation \\<longleftrightarrow>\n    observation_octet_scope C U F rows \\<and> list_all (\\<lambda>(c,d). c<256 \\<and> d<256) relation\"\n  by (simp only: investigation_input_octets_def investigation_input_encoded investigation_input_subject_lists\n      observation_octet_scope_def observation_scope_encoded)\n    (auto simp: list_all_iff octets_formed_def split: prod.splits)\n\nexport_code investigation_input_octets nat_of_integer integer_of_nat\n  in SML module_name Native_Investigation_Input file_prefix native_investigation_input\n\ntext \\<open>\n  The exported Boolean is defined by the actual native whole-input call.\n  Its proved equation checks the complete original scope and every comparison\n  endpoint. A comparison row may lie outside the candidate set. Octets are a\n  finite testing interface; the native contracts cover all admitted data terms.\n\\<close>\n\nend\n",
          "sha256": "ac53ff5e12246f4d24aadcb45079400753592432281adc84ce9754debe39b163"
        },
